# Bruno, The Protector

> Bruno is a crit-stacking marksman who now wins fights before they start. The 2.2.16 rework turned Worldie into a long-range hook that drops its first target at the edge of his attack range. Pick him when your team can hold a line, and avoid him when the enemy out-ranges you.

